H0501H.def:
A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 8:37; 
son of: Binea (H1150); 
brother of: Raphah (H7498) and Azel (H0682A); 
father of: Ulam (H0198H), Jeush (H3266I) and Eliphelet (H0467J); also called Eshek at 1 Chroniques 8:39; 
Also named: e.sheq (עֵ֫שֶׁק "Eshek" H6232)
§ Elasah or Eleasah = "God has made"
1) a descendant of Judah, son of Helez
2) a priest of Pashur's line with a foreign wife during Ezra's time
3) Shaphan's son, Zedekiah's servant
4) a descendant of Benjamin, son of Rapha, father of Azel

H0508.def:
A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 8:11; 
son of: Shaharaim (H7842) and Hushim (H2366A); 
brother of: Jobab (H3103J), Zibia (H6644), Mesha (H4331), Malcam (H4445A), Jeuz (H3263), Sachia (H7634), Mirmah (H4821) and Abitub (H0036); 
father of: Eber (H5677I), Misham (H4936), Shemed (H8106B), Beriah (H1283I), Shema (H8087I), Zebadiah (H2069H), Meshullam (H4918J), Hizki (H2395), Heber (H2268J), Ishmerai (H3461), Izliah (H3152), Jobab (H3103K) 
§ Elpaal = "God is maker"
a Benjamite

H0526H.def:
A king of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 2 Rois 21:18; 
son of: Manasseh (H4519H) and Meshullemeth (H4922); married to Jedidah (H3040); 
father of: Josiah (H2977); also called Amos at Matthieu 1:10; 
§ Amon = "skilled workman" or "master workman"
1) a king of Judah, son of Manasseh
2) a governor of Samaria
3) a descendant of a servant of Solomon

H0550G.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 2 Samuel 3:2; 
son of: David (H1732) and Ahinoam (H0293H); 
half-brother of: Chileab (H3609), Absalom (H0053), Adonijah (H0138), Shephatiah (H8203), Ithream (H3507), Shammua (H8051H), Shobab (H7727), Nathan (H5416), Solomon (H8010), Ibhar (H2984), Elishua (H0474), Nepheg (H5298H), Japhia (H3309I), Elishama (H0476H), Eliada (H0450), Eliphelet (H0467), Tamar (H8559H), Elpelet (H0467I), Nogah (H5052) and Jerimoth (H3406N)
§ Amnon = "faithful"
1) oldest son of David, rapist of Tamar, slain by Absalom
2) a son of Shimon (of Caleb's clan)

H0550H.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah(?) living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 4:20; 
son of: Shimon (H7889); 
brother of: Rinnah (H7441), Ben-hanan (H1135) , Tilon (H8436)
§ Amnon = "faithful"
1) oldest son of David, rapist of Tamar, slain by Absalom
2) a son of Shimon (of Caleb's clan)

H0557G.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 6:46; 
son of: Bani (H1137H); 
father of: Hilkiah (H2518I)
§ Amzi = "my strength"
1) a Levite
2) the ancestor of a returned exile in the priestly line

H0557H.def:
A man living at the time of Exile and Return, only mentioned at Néhémie 11:12; 
son of: Zechariah (H2148X); 
father of: Pelaliah (H6421)
§ Amzi = "my strength"
1) a Levite
2) the ancestor of a returned exile in the priestly line

H0566G.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Exile and Return, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 9:4; 
son of: Bani (H1137I); 
father of: Omri (H6018I)
§ Imri = "eloquent"
1) a man of Judah
2) an ancestor of one of Nehemiah's helpers

H0583.def:
A man living at the time before the Flood, first mentioned at Genèse 4:26; 
son of: Seth (H8352); 
father of: Kenan (H7018); also called Enos at Luc 3:38; 
Also named: Enōs (Ἐνώς "Enos" G1800) 
§ Enos = "man"
son of Seth

H0593.def:
A man of the tribe of Manasseh living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 7:19; 
son of: Shemida (H8061); 
brother of: Ahian (H0291), Shechem (H7928H) and Likhi (H3949) 
§ Aniam = "I am the people" or "lament of people"
a man of Manasseh
